    <item>
      <title>XGuide - Process Integration and Design Optimization</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/projects/xguide/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/projects/xguide/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Simulated unsteady &lt;strong&gt;vortex shedding&lt;/strong&gt; around underwater cylinders at Re = 10,000 using the &lt;strong&gt;RANS-SST&lt;/strong&gt; turbulence model. Analyzed unsteady pressure fluctuations, wake dynamics, and vortex-induced vibrations (VIV) — phenomena critical to marine structural stability and fatigue life. Generated flow animations and spectral frequency plots; validated against experimental benchmarks.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
